<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <RootNamespace>Microsoft.VisualBasic.MIME.text.markdown</RootNamespace>
    <TargetFrameworks>net10.0</TargetFrameworks>
    <AssemblyName>Microsoft.VisualBasic.MIME.text.markdown</AssemblyName>
    <Platforms>AnyCPU;x64</Platforms>
    <Configurations>Debug;Release;LipidSearch;Rsharp_app_release;mzkit_win32;gcmodeller_desktop;nuget_release</Configurations>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>true</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>true</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
    <AutoGenerateBindingRedirects>True</AutoGenerateBindingRedirects>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>True</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <PackageProjectUrl>http://scibasic.net/</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/xieguigang/sciBASIC</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <Version>1.0.9762.11310</Version>
    <AssemblyVersion>1.0.9762.11310</AssemblyVersion>
    <Title>Markdown Parser, Block Model and Multi-Format Renderer</Title>
    <Description>A markdown processor for sciBASIC#: a two-phase recursive block and inline parser that renders markdown to HTML or plain text, a typed block model with markdown and HTML renderers driven by JSON documents, plus nested table-of-contents generation from ATX headers.</Description>
    <AssemblyTitle>Microsoft.VisualBasic.MIME.text.markdown</AssemblyTitle>
    <Authors>xieguigang &lt;I@xieguigang.me&gt;</Authors>
    <Company>sciBASIC.NET Foundation</Company>
    <Copyright>Copyright (c) sciBASIC.NET Foundation</Copyright>
    <PackageTags>scibasic;markdown;markdown-parser;html-renderer;text-renderer;table-of-contents;json;document</PackageTags>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>The markdown processor of sciBASIC#. Parsing: MarkdownParser is a two phase recursive parser - block level tokenization followed by inline span parsing - so nested lists, block quotes containing headers or lists, and tables with inline formatting all work through recursion. Output: MarkdownRender.Transform renders markdown to HTML, or to plain text when constructed with a TextRender; the abstract Render base class defines the pluggable output contract implemented by HtmlRender and TextRender, and an image URL router is exposed for rewriting embedded image locations. Block model: JSONSchema.Block is a typed block model (type, level, content, headers, rows and list data) suited to structured content such as large language model output - JSONRenderer.Parse turns a JSON document into an IEnumerable(Of Block), while ToMarkdown / ToHtml render them back out and BlockRenderer converts a single block. Table of contents: TOC.GenerateToc builds a nested markdown list from ATX headers, TOC.AddToc prepends it to the document, and MarkdownRender.GetTOC returns each header text together with its level.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>GPL-3.0-or-later</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageIcon>logo-knot.png</PackageIcon>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <IncludeSymbols>True</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='nuget_release|x64'">
    <PlatformTarget>x64</PlatformTarget>
    <RemoveIntegerChecks>true</RemoveIntegerChecks>
    <DebugSymbols>true</DebugSymbols>
    <DebugType>full</DebugType>
    <OutputPath>../../.nuget/</OutputPath>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='Debug|AnyCPU'">
    <DocumentationFile>Microsoft.VisualBasic.MIME.text.markdown.xml</DocumentationFile>
    <DebugSymbols>true</DebugSymbols>
    <DebugType>full</DebugType>
    <DefineConstants>netcore5=1</DefineConstants>
  </PropertyGroup>

